            0.293
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "X-inactivation",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Inactivation of one copy of the X chromosome in the somatic cells of female mammals. (Chapter 7)"
            }
          ]
        },
